      "body": "Optional test suggestion: set `signetchallenge=51` in the `[signet]` config section and also pass `-signetchallenge=51` on the command line, then assert the multiple-values error.\r\n\r\nThis would cover the `GetArg()` -> `GetArgs()` change across configuration sources, using valid, identical values. Running this case with RPC unavailable would also verify that the diagnostic does not depend on a running node.",
